commit 6421b87be307fdbb83da3a2d18abdc0f089b8ca1
Author: Nicholas Hemsley <nick.hems@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jan 30 14:43:56 2026 +0800

    feat(agent_ui): Change MRU to Ctrl+Alt and show numbers in picker
    
    - Change model selector modal trigger from Ctrl to Ctrl+Alt
    - Change MRU keybindings from Ctrl+1-9 to Ctrl+Alt+1-9
    - Display MRU index (1-9) next to models in 'Most Recently Used' section
    - Add mru_index field to ModelSelectorListItem for visual display
    
    This makes it clearer which Ctrl+Alt+number corresponds to which model.
    
    Related: zed-vb7.4

